      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260704112058.95421-1-simon.schippers@tu-dortmund.de/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260704112058.95421-1-simon.schippers@tu-dortmund.de/mbox/",
      "hash": "7edf68c8f5a54a96b2ae3a96a638d4265faada0c",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Simon Schippers",
      "date": "2026-07-04T11:20:58",
      "summary": "该补丁针对 TUN/TAP 和 vhost-net 驱动中因引入 qdisc 背压机制导致的性能回退问题。原提交 1d6e569b7d0c 在多 iperf3 TCP 流场景下性能从 13.5 Gbit/s 降至 9.13 Gbit/s。补丁新增 IFF_BACKPRESSURE 标志，使 qdisc 背压行为变为 opt-in：仅当该标志启用时，tun_net_xmit() 的停队列逻辑和 __tun_wake_queue() 的唤醒逻辑才生效。同时在 tun_set_iff() 中改为遍历所有 tfile 并在持锁下唤醒队列、cons_cnt 复位，防止与 tun_net_xmit() 并发停队列造成 stall。文档同步更新。",
      "tags": [
        "驱动",
        "包处理",
        "性能"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14663756,
      "title": "[bpf-next,v6,2/3] bpf: Add BPF_FIB_LOOKUP_VLAN_INPUT flag to bpf_fib_lookup() helper",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260704092159.1256823-3-avinash.duduskar@gmail.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260704092159.1256823-3-avinash.duduskar@gmail.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260704092159.1256823-3-avinash.duduskar@gmail.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "90cd9b367542ba9495abd9268843a9d88877f5e3",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Avinash Duduskar",
      "date": "2026-07-04T09:21:58",
      "summary": "该补丁为 eBPF 的 bpf_fib_lookup() 辅助函数新增 BPF_FIB_LOOKUP_VLAN_INPUT 标志。当 XDP 程序在物理设备上收到带 VLAN 标签的帧时，可通过该标志将 params->h_vlan_proto/TCI 作为输入 VLAN 标签解析，使用 __vlan_find_dev_deep_rcu() 找到 params->ifindex 上对应的 VLAN 子接口作为实际 ingress 设备，从而保证 iif-based 策略路由和 VRF 表选择使用正确的入口。若 params->ifindex 本身是 VLAN 设备则匹配其内层（QinQ）子接口；bond/team 上标签不匹配任一端口时返回 NOT_FWDED；目标设备必须为 up 且与 ifindex 同 namespace。解析后设备作为 flowi4_iif 喂入 flow，使 l3mdev 规则从子接口而非原始 ifindex 解析 VRF master，从而保证 DIRECT 与完整查找都能正确选中 VRF 表。",
      "tags": [
        "eBPF",
        "XDP",
        "路由"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 5
    },
    {
      "id": 14663715,
      "title": "[v4] r8169: migrate Rx path to page_pool, prepare for XDP",
