      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Atharva Potdar",
      "date": "2026-07-04T08:06:53",
      "summary": "r8169网卡驱动将Rx接收路径迁移至page_pool API。新MAC（VER_06之后）将原本alloc_pages()+skb_copy_to_linear_data()替换为napi_build_skb()零拷贝接收，并为后续XDP支持铺路。每个缓冲区预留XDP_PACKET_HEADROOM空间，避免桥接/路由场景下skb_push()失败导致pskb_expand_head()反复重分配。旧MAC（VER_06及之前）保留拷贝路径。page_pool固定order-2(SZ_16K)分配，与现有R8169_RX_BUF_SIZE一致，不改变每描述符分配大小或巨帧行为。代码上将Rx消费循环(cur_rx)与缓冲补充循环(dirty_rx)解耦，仅当napi_build_skb()真正获得页面所有权时才替换描述符，规避内存压力下的Tx watchdog超时。",
      "tags": [
        "驱动",
        "XDP",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 12
    },
    {
      "id": 14663660,
      "title": "[nf] netfilter: ipset: skip extension destroy on hash resize replay",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260704062234.2625208-1-bestswngs@gmail.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260704062234.2625208-1-bestswngs@gmail.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260704062234.2625208-1-bestswngs@gmail.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "9fe1ba2726bf5938cbb1d1276623a530a2d2e617",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Weiming Shi",
      "date": "2026-07-04T06:22:34",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 netfilter ipset 哈希表 resize 过程中的 use-after-free / double-free 问题。在 mtype_resize() 通过 memcpy() 将旧表元素拷贝到新表时，comment 扩展结构仍指向旧表内存；若此时内核侧对旧表执行 xt_SET 删除，ip_set_ext_destroy() 会释放共享的扩展结构并通过 h->ad 队列记录一个 replayed delete。resize 表交换后 replay 会在新表上调用 mtype_del()，此时 ext 已为 NULL，但旧代码仍无条件调用 ip_set_ext_destroy() 并解引用 ext->target，导致 RCU 双重释放。修复方法是在 mtype_del() 中对 ext 做 NULL 判断，仅当 ext 非空时才调用 ip_set_ext_destroy() 并访问 ext->target，避免重复释放和空指针解引用。",
      "tags": [
        "Netfilter",
        "Linux内核网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 4
    },
    {
      "id": 14663651,
