      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Maoyi Xie",
      "date": "2026-07-04T06:15:11",
      "summary": "修复 Marvell Octeon EP VF 网卡驱动 RX 路径中 skb frags 溢出的漏洞。原代码在 `__octep_vf_oq_process_rx()` 中对描述符返回长度按 `buffer_size` 切分添加 frags，无上限检查。当超长数据包产生约 18 个分片时，会超过默认 `MAX_SKB_FRAGS`（17）的限制，导致 `skb_add_rx_frag()` 越界写入 `shinfo->frags[]`。补丁新增 `octep_vf_oq_drop_rx()` 辅助函数在分片数超限时丢弃报文并回收描述符（包括 DMA unmap），同时统一处理 `napi_build_skb()` 失败路径，避免内存破坏并修复资源泄漏。",
      "tags": [
        "驱动",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14663650,
      "title": "[net,v3,1/2] octeon_ep: fix skb frags overflow in the RX path",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260704061511.2350737-2-maoyixie.tju@gmail.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260704061511.2350737-2-maoyixie.tju@gmail.com/",
